          "filename": "The city of Panama From the Tivoli Hotel, Ancon - DPLA - 0584c6673e5f59beedca3be96b96b1e0.jpg",
          "caption": "Wuerth, Louis A. \"Catalogue of the lithographs of Joseph Pennell.\" Little, Brown and Company, 1931, Boston.; Date from catalogue raisonné.; Title from catalogue raisonné (lithographs).; Wuerth 1931 (L): 242; Part of the \"Panama\" series.; Jo Pennell; \"From the wing of the Government hotel in which I stayed I looked out over the city of Panama to the Pacific. If this city were in Spain, or if even a decent description of it were in an European guide-book, the hordes of Americans who go to the Canal would rave over it. As it is, not may of them (not being told) ever see it, though there are few towns in Europe with more character. Joseph Pennell.\"",
